# Internal reference files
_intern/
# Footage: only the encoded file the manifest names is ever deployed — build.js copies
# nothing else — so the repo carries the .webp and none of the inputs behind it. HEIC
# originals belong in OneDrive; the .jpg/.png are intermediates `npm run footage`
# regenerates from them, and peter-and-co.png is regenerated by mondriaan-plane.js.
#
# The catch: this assumes an encoded sibling exists. Without ffmpeg the encoder no-ops,
# the manifest falls back to naming the .jpg, and that file is ignored here — so the
# plane would silently lose its photograph. `npm run footage` warns when that happens.
footage/*.heic
footage/*.HEIC
footage/*.heif
footage/*.jpg
footage/*.jpeg
footage/*.png
# Footprint tool: local-only absolute paths (never commit)
tools/footprint/archive.local.json
